From 0a37d7447ca67b0b46b5d73b425868ca1e437c9a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 5LIM3 <alozieanyatonwu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 06:50:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: stop exhausting CurrencyFreaks quota, restore
 KWD/SAR/IQD feed

Root cause of 'chart isn't moving' / NEVER CONNECTED on KWD/SAR/IQD:
the 45s live-data poll called CurrencyFreaks directly every cycle
(~1,920 req/day), blowing through its 1000/month free quota within
hours of deploy, after which every call failed silently.

- KWD/SAR/IQD now source primarily from open.er-api.com (free, no
  key, no request quota).
- CurrencyFreaks kept only as an optional fallback, now quota-gated
  to one real network call per hour (CURRENCYFREAKS_MIN_INTERVAL_MS)
  regardless of poll frequency, so it can't re-exhaust a quota again.
- Updated README/.env.example/engine.js comments to match.
---
 .env.example         | 11 ++++--
 README.md            | 19 +++++-----
 server/engine.js     |  6 ++--
 server/index.js      |  7 ++--
 server/marketData.js | 83 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 5 files changed, 93 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.env.example b/.env.example
index 5a6426f..0f35a9c 100644
--- a/.env.example
+++ b/.env.example
@@ -22,6 +22,13 @@ SMTP_FROM=VertexFX Demo <no-reply@vertexfx.demo>
 # reliable but requires free signup (https://twelvedata.com, rate-limited).
 TWELVE_DATA_API_KEY=
 
-# KWD/USDT needs a free CurrencyFreaks API key (https://currencyfreaks.com — free
-# tier signup, no card required). Without it, KWD/USDT stays fully simulated.
+# KWD/SAR/IQD vs USDT use open.er-api.com by default (free, no key, no quota) —
+# nothing to configure. CURRENCYFREAKS_API_KEY is OPTIONAL, only used as a
+# fallback if open.er-api.com is ever unreachable, and is internally capped to
+# one real request/hour so it can't blow through a free-tier monthly quota
+# again (get a free key at https://currencyfreaks.com if you want this).
 CURRENCYFREAKS_API_KEY=
+
+# Optional: how often the CurrencyFreaks fallback is allowed to make a real
+# network call, in ms. Default 3600000 (1 hour).
+CURRENCYFREAKS_MIN_INTERVAL_MS=
