-- **Forex** (EUR/GBP/JPY/AUD/CAD/CHF vs USD) — Frankfurter/ECB, no key
-- **Metals & indices** (XAU/XAG, US30/US100/SPX500) — tries Stooq first, then Yahoo Finance's
